  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/392",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/407\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/407</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/407\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=fMHp&amp;datanum=407\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/407\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/407\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3년전에 만든</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">메타인지 게임(이승윤2 게임)을(위 링크 글) 웹앱화 하여&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생들과 함께 수업시간에 진행 해보았습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">종이로 했던 게임(이전 내용)은 조별로 조 안에서 문제를 출제하고 문제를 풀었던 반면에</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">웹앱은 반 전체 학생들이 함께 게임을 진행합니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">라운드를 설정하여 시간내에 진행할 수 있게 할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"> 제 블로그 글을 그대로 옮겨 봅니다. </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">--------------</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5169382d54544bf18cc70edb9f86d973de7d5fd3\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5169382d54544bf18cc70edb9f86d973de7d5fd3\" data-origin-width=\"812\" data-origin-height=\"651\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">로그인 화면</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">오른쪽 상단에 비밀번호 설정을 1회 할 수 있음.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size26\"><b>[ 학생 모드 화면 ]</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/084897c955e792bc77860854dc14ced84fde5140\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/084897c955e792bc77860854dc14ced84fde5140\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"413\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">로그인 해서 들어가면</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">왼쪽에는 메타점수와 인지점수 그리고 각 점수를 획득하는 방법이 나옵니다.</span></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f942673c977a111516903f72debb98d3498f9410\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"324\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f942673c977a111516903f72debb98d3498f9410\" data-origin-width=\"324\" data-origin-height=\"332\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">오른쪽은 참여할 수 있는 프로젝트 리스트가 나옵니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 그림에서는 프로젝트가 한개만 나옴</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">프로젝트는 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">관리자 모드(교사 모드)에서(웹상에서) 만들 수 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">만들때 라운드 개수 설정을 할 수 있습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6229da57c531bf640e81de966406d3f15471d5fc\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6229da57c531bf640e81de966406d3f15471d5fc\" data-origin-width=\"320\" data-origin-height=\"122\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 사진은 총 3라운드 중 현재 3라운드라는 의미임.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">라운드별로</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생들이 한개의 문제를 출제할 수 있고</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">친구들의 문제를 한번 풀 수 있습니다</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">총 3라운드면 해당 프로젝트에서는 3번의 문제를 출제해야 하고</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">3번의 친구들 문제를 풀 수 있는 타임이 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">라운드 횟수 설정도 교사모드에서 프로젝트 만들때 설정할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ece8a7064fa29d93962548857f441d55204126d4\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ece8a7064fa29d93962548857f441d55204126d4\" data-origin-width=\"830\" data-origin-height=\"841\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">문제 출제 화면</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">문제 내용 입력</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">사진을 추가 할 수 있음(선택사항)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">5지 선다형의 보기(앞에 정답을 라디오버튼식)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">정답 해설</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">출제하면서 해당 문제를 몇명의 친구들이 맞출 수 있는지 설정</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 그림을 보면 1~4 중 선택&#160;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">5명에게 해당 문제가 배정이 되는데 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">모든 학생이 다 틀리거나 모든 학생이 다 맞추는 문제를 출제하면 안됩니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">그래서 1~4 명 중 선택.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">마지막으로 문제가 친구들에게 보여질때 이 문제의 출제자가 누구인지를 공개할 것이냐를 선택할 수 있습니다</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be19689208c773a78f088eca5f96c5f178be8fa0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be19689208c773a78f088eca5f96c5f178be8fa0\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"379\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">친구들의 문제를 몇문제를 풀지도</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">교사모드에서 프로젝트 만들때 설정할수 있습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">교사모드에서 [랜덤 배정] 버튼을 누르면</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">친구들의 문제를 풀 수 있게 됩니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">친구들 문제 풀때</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">이 문제를 맞출 수 있는지, 틀릴것 같은지를 선택하는 항목이 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">그래서 메타인지 게임</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc94d6248f15c3264e55fed09acdcca4cdad2ed0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"370\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc94d6248f15c3264e55fed09acdcca4cdad2ed0\" data-origin-width=\"370\" data-origin-height=\"91\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/64c3eef4883da7ed942c87767589f10df449f6d8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"345\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/64c3eef4883da7ed942c87767589f10df449f6d8\" data-origin-width=\"345\" data-origin-height=\"97\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size26\"><b>[ 교사 모드(관리자 모드) 화면 ]</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52c30f50082e51f91f7a559811ea7bfcb4f99db4\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52c30f50082e51f91f7a559811ea7bfcb4f99db4\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"552\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">교사모드에서는</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">로그하면 왼쪽에는</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">반별 점수들의 현황을 볼 수 있습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d745bf815ce3e9733c4f40bd535ca9bd738050f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"499\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d745bf815ce3e9733c4f40bd535ca9bd738050f\" data-origin-width=\"499\" data-origin-height=\"748\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ecb00b9f9f97b124216c17dc79e6204e248c54d7\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ecb00b9f9f97b124216c17dc79e6204e248c54d7\" data-origin-width=\"559\" data-origin-height=\"480\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생의 이름을 클릭하면</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생별 세부 정보를 알 수 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">현재는 프로젝트가 한개여서 한개만 나오고</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">프로젝트를 클릭하면</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/906c026662dbfc059f8ff734f708f7df04b72092\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/906c026662dbfc059f8ff734f708f7df04b72092\" data-origin-width=\"555\" data-origin-height=\"502\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">프로젝트에 설정된 라운드 수가 나옵니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">각 라운드를 클릭해보면</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/87294da6058e2b1425f4325eb84a0cf7f1356a3e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/87294da6058e2b1425f4325eb84a0cf7f1356a3e\" data-origin-width=\"552\" data-origin-height=\"725\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">각 라운드에서 출제한 문제와 그 문제에 설정한 내용들을 볼 수 있습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ccda4ec70b8483b14417ef9872138de060f6bdb1\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ccda4ec70b8483b14417ef9872138de060f6bdb1\" data-origin-width=\"544\" data-origin-height=\"852\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">그 밑에는</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">그 라운드에서 친구들 문제를 어떤것을 풀었고 어떻게 답 체크 하였는지 확인 할 수 있습니다</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">--------------------------------</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size26\"><b>메타인지 게임 프로그램 설치&#160;</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1OkiPqlPvPQfIWQl-F6EwTDfZOSuiosfj83lhVBAiOKA/edit?gid=328159099#gid=328159099\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1OkiPqlPvPQfIWQl-F6EwTDfZOSuiosfj83lhVBAiOKA/edit?gid=328159099#gid=328159099</a></b></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"[배포판] 메타인지 게임(이승윤2 게임)\" data-og-description=\"이 브라우저 버전은 더 이상 지원되지 않습니다. 지원되는 브라우저로 업그레이드하세요.\" data-og-host=\"docs.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1OkiPqlPvPQfIWQl-F6EwTDfZOSuiosfj83lhVBAiOKA/edit?gid=328159099#gid=328159099\" data-og-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1OkiPqlPvPQfIWQl-F6EwTDfZOSuiosfj83lhVBAiOKA/edit?gid=328159099&amp;usp=embed_facebook\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dq0nlD/dJMb8PGwPs1/NrgBMrslXEEPG9D5v5zEIk/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1OkiPqlPvPQfIWQl-F6EwTDfZOSuiosfj83lhVBAiOKA/edit?gid=328159099#gid=328159099\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1OkiPqlPvPQfIWQl-F6EwTDfZOSuiosfj83lhVBAiOKA/edit?gid=328159099#gid=328159099\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dq0nlD/dJMb8PGwPs1/NrgBMrslXEEPG9D5v5zEIk/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">[배포판] 메타인지 게임(이승윤2 게임)</p><p class=\"og-desc\">이 브라우저 버전은 더 이상 지원되지 않습니다. 지원되는 브라우저로 업그레이드하세요.</p><p class=\"og-host\">docs.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>1. 위 링크 클릭!</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/659cfc645511237571870bb9c4e63360a3a97ac6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/659cfc645511237571870bb9c4e63360a3a97ac6\" data-origin-width=\"446\" data-origin-height=\"237\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>2. [파일] - [사본 만들기] 클릭</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7be27ad90b1fe9782558333ffc096b8ffcbe3b2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7be27ad90b1fe9782558333ffc096b8ffcbe3b2\" data-origin-width=\"873\" data-origin-height=\"847\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>3. 사본으로 만들어진 </b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>구글 스프레드 시트의 아래 시트[Admin_Settings] 의 J1 셀에</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>구글 드라이브 ID 를 넣어주셔야 합니다.</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/159b5c0743532731a32395acf1b0b3013236e858\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/159b5c0743532731a32395acf1b0b3013236e858\" data-origin-width=\"473\" data-origin-height=\"792\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>3-1. 구글 드라이브 새폴더 만들어 ID 넣기</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>가. 크롬-오른쪽 상단 [점9개] 클릭- [드라이브] 아이콘 클릭</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/26903378726331eecd22ca6cccf54a98cec5c614\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/26903378726331eecd22ca6cccf54a98cec5c614\" data-origin-width=\"240\" data-origin-height=\"176\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>나. 드라이브에서 [+신규] 클릭</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d564f0ae10375cb7a0870ffef9ba52bc87cbea4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d564f0ae10375cb7a0870ffef9ba52bc87cbea4\" data-origin-width=\"443\" data-origin-height=\"222\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>다. [새 폴더] 클릭</b> </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29ac06bd1ffa2de982165f689c276e19b10e45cd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29ac06bd1ffa2de982165f689c276e19b10e45cd\" data-origin-width=\"541\" data-origin-height=\"299\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>라. 폴더 이름 정하고 - [만들기] 클릭</b> </span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81fa880df03140242f9614316669140a675fb3bf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81fa880df03140242f9614316669140a675fb3bf\" data-origin-width=\"1537\" data-origin-height=\"397\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>마. 만들어진 폴더의 오른쪽 [점3개] 클릭 - [공유] 클릭 - [공유] 클릭</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca37b16057df1499648fc51109bf437e4392b3d8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca37b16057df1499648fc51109bf437e4392b3d8\" data-origin-width=\"679\" data-origin-height=\"258\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">바. [제한됨] 클릭 - [링크가 있는 모든 사용자] 클릭</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3daa37cfb03594936f9ff73a0387fa8a5fa4f9c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3daa37cfb03594936f9ff73a0387fa8a5fa4f9c\" data-origin-width=\"628\" data-origin-height=\"367\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">사. [뷰어] 클릭 - [편집자]로 바꿈</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c012a93e98d1e5a77594a616c8b194b887ade3cb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c012a93e98d1e5a77594a616c8b194b887ade3cb\" data-origin-width=\"638\" data-origin-height=\"290\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">링크가 있는 모든 사용자가 편집자 확인 후 [완료] 클릭</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2f6a8a56ffff1fb082f6a23cbc6d7c4a26645c4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2f6a8a56ffff1fb082f6a23cbc6d7c4a26645c4\" data-origin-width=\"776\" data-origin-height=\"211\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">[메타인지 게임] 더블 클릭</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/31a3dfc4a8c5e6d3293ca8c20a3f8b913bad069b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/31a3dfc4a8c5e6d3293ca8c20a3f8b913bad069b\" data-origin-width=\"859\" data-origin-height=\"374\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">인터넷 주소 창에&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">/(슬레시) 뒤에 나오는 문구(알파벳+숫자)로 이루어진 것이 구글 드라이브ID 입니다</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이 부분을 복사하여</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"> <b>[Admin_Settings] 의 J1 셀에 넣으시면 됩니다.</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>앱스크립트 설치</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b6ade4010b531777bd0588f8ccb96c2a2f598096\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b6ade4010b531777bd0588f8ccb96c2a2f598096\" data-origin-width=\"768\" data-origin-height=\"372\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">[확장 프로그램] 클릭 - [Apps script] 클릭</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79795dd2afd93fe21b8f6a24db610c60cc7cbc36\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79795dd2afd93fe21b8f6a24db610c60cc7cbc36\" data-origin-width=\"395\" data-origin-height=\"324\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">[배포] - [새 배포] 클릭</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a4c7a030f1336651b575a6250f1b16783c66c64\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a4c7a030f1336651b575a6250f1b16783c66c64\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"543\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ddf45c834d24fe0979e260830a3d486dab54bfdc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ddf45c834d24fe0979e260830a3d486dab54bfdc\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"536\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size26\"> 설명서 </span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>11반은 관리자모드(교사모드) 로그인할 수 있는 이름과 비밀번호를 넣으시면 됩니다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>나머지 1~10반 시트는 학생 이름을 넣으시고</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>학생들이 각자 비밀번호 설정을 하면 됩니다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/19564bde21028f197b14fc19533303cacc790774\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/19564bde21028f197b14fc19533303cacc790774\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"467\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>관리자모드(교사모드)에서 프로젝트에 들어가 </b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>[1. 랜덤 배정 하기] 버튼을 눌러야</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>학생들이 친구들 문제를 풀 수 있게 되며</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>[2. 라운드 채점 및 종료] 버튼을 눌러야 다음 라운드로 넘어갑니다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/224184472471\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://blog.naver.com/sayment/224184472471</a></b></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"수업용/업무용 프로그램 배포\" data-og-description=\"수업용/업무용 프로그램 배포 수업용은 범교과 / 모든 단원용입니다 1. 수업보조시스템 - 기능 : 학생 동료...\" data-og-host=\"blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/224184472471\" data-og-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/224184472471\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ecFoSO/dJMb8PGwRvy/bnPGgiQc5BcC6LXZFEP9k0/img.png?width=170&amp;height=170&amp;face=0_0_170_170\"><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/224184472471\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/224184472471\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ecFoSO/dJMb8PGwRvy/bnPGgiQc5BcC6LXZFEP9k0/img.png?width=170&amp;height=170&amp;face=0_0_170_170\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">수업용/업무용 프로그램 배포</p><p class=\"og-desc\">수업용/업무용 프로그램 배포 수업용은 범교과 / 모든 단원용입니다 1. 수업보조시스템 - 기능 : 학생 동료...</p><p class=\"og-host\">blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>위 링크에 들어가시면 </b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>그간 만든&#160;</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>범교과/ 모든 단원 용 프로그램(웹앱)을 설치하실 수 있습니다</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>1. 글/그림 학생 동료평가 프로그램, 수행평가점수 확인 기능 (구글 드라이브ID 필요)</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>2. 반편성 프로그램</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>3. 상벌점 프로그램</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>4. 학생 동료 문항 출제 프로그램(제미나이API키 필요)</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>5. 메타인지 게임(구글 드라이브ID 필요)</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
